  "details": "You can see me reproducing this issue in this video:\n\nhttps://youtu.be/U02p7tvjyz4\n\n1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Press escape to open the \"Small Menu\"\n\n3. Choose \"Worlds\" in the middle, in Quick Links\n\n4. Choose \"Search Worlds\" on the left\n\n5. When you click \"Enter a search term\", it does not open the virtual keyboard and nothing happens.\n\nNow if I do it for a second time, the keyboard shows up automatically.\n\nIt seems to happen only the first time you try to do it, when you run the game.\n\nWhen I changed lobbies and tested it, it worked without any issues.",
